@startuml
' Yang Shuo with OpenAI Codex assistance. #641; Benjamin's relationship-search feature retained.
' Trace: CanonicalSearchCommand.execute; PeopleView.setSearchCriteria;
' PersonRelationshipSearch.search; PersonContactSearch.search;
' LessonQueries.searchLessons/getStudentsByParentPhone.
!include feature-sequence-style.iuml
participant "command :\nCanonicalSearchCommand" as C
participant "view :\nPeopleView" as V
participant "<<class>>\nPersonRelationshipSearch" as R
participant "queries :\nLessonQueries" as Q

C -> V : setSearchCriteria(\ncriteria)
V -> R : search(people, queries, criteria)
R -> R : Filter category and own fields\nusing PersonContactSearch
opt relationship criteria supplied
  alt Student or Tutor
    R -> Q : Find matching lessons;\nread current roster
  else Parent
    R -> Q : Use parent-phone index;\nread matching lessons
  end
  note over R, Q
    Match own fields and all related
    filters on the same Lesson/child.
  end note
end
R --> V : distinct people in creation order\nand matching relationship contexts
V -> V : Store criteria; publish people\nand result context
V --> C : updated count
note over C, Q : No operational save; right-pane selection is unchanged.
@enduml
